    "lawCode": "Amd §11-0907, En Con L",
    "lawSection": "Environmental Conservation Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S5082A\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\nAn act\nto amend the environmental conservation law, in relation to hunting in\nthe county of Madison\n\nPURPOSE:\nThis bill would make permanent provisions for use of rifles\nfor deer hunting in Madison County.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\nThis bill would make the provisions permanent the\nability of hunters to utilize a rifle for hunting in Madison County.\nIt is important to note that the use of rifles in Madison County has\nbeen endorsed by the County Board of Supervisors.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\nNew bill.\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\nNone.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately, with provisions.\n\n",
